## Original Content
O ministro dos Negócios Estrangeiros diz que só a AD, com a sua moderação pode governar o País, já que o PS é sinónimo de "laxismo" e "deixa-andar-a-ver-se dá" e Chega de "demagogia e mentira".

## Summary
The Minister of Foreign Affairs, Rangel, states that only the Democratic Alliance (AD) can effectively govern the country due to its moderate stance, contrasting the Socialist Party (PS) with accusations of laxity and the Chega party with allegations of demagoguery and falsehoods.

## Key Points
- Rangel endorses the Democratic Alliance (AD) as the only capable party to govern the country due to its moderation.
- The Socialist Party (PS) is criticized for "laxismo" (laxness) and an attitude of "deixa-andar-a-ver-se" (let things happen).
- The Chega party is accused of "demagogia" (demagoguery) and "mentira" (lying).


